cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the paper below."
title: "Conformal Crop Classification Across Regions with Sentinel-2 Time Series"
abstract: >-
  Code, trained models, and evaluation artefacts for a study of the geographic
  coverage gap: the loss of conditional coverage that appears when a conformal
  predictor calibrated in one region is deployed in another. Covers 85,618
  surveyed fields across 79 districts of Pakistan over two cropping seasons.
